#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:15
msgid "Using Eclipse Oxygen with ``rviz2`` [community-contributed] - tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:18
msgid ""
"Eclipse Oxygen can be configured as a C++ development environment for "
"``rviz2`` and its dependencies. This article explains how to import the "
"required repositories, configure ``ament`` builds, and update the Eclipse "
"indexer. After you follow it, Eclipse can build, index, and debug the "
"workspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:28
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:31
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:33
msgid ""
"This tutorial assumes Eclipse Oxygen, git, and `Egit <http://www.eclipse.org/"
"egit/download/>`_ are already installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:35
msgid ""
"Throughout the tutorial we name the eclipse workspace the same name as the "
"ros2 package, but this is not required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:37
msgid ""
"HINT: We use nested projects and one Eclipse Workspace for each ROS-2 "
"package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:41
msgid "Create a C++ Project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:50
msgid ""
"Choose the ROS 2 package name as the Project Name. Choose a Makefile Project "
"and Other Toolchain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:56
msgid "Click on Finish"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:61
msgid "Our project should be shown in the \"Project Explorer\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:66
msgid "Inside our Project create a folder called \"src\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:71
msgid "Import a git repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:76
msgid "Put in the repository URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:81
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Use the source folder of the project we created before as the "
"destination folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:83
msgid ""
"HINT: If you ran into problems choosing the destination folder path, the "
"Eclipse Dialog needs a name in the name field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:88
msgid "Import using the new project wizard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:93
msgid "Create a General->Project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:98
msgid ""
"Use the git repository name as the project name. IMPORTANT: Use the folder "
"we cloned the git repository in as the \"Location\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:104
msgid ""
"The git project and the new project should be visible in the Project "
"Explorer view. The same files are listed multiple times, but only one "
"project is linked with Egit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:110
msgid "Repeat this procedure again. Import git repository pluginlib."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:116
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Use a folder inside the source folder as \"Destination-"
">Directory\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:121
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Use the folder we cloned the git repository in as the location "
"for the new project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:126
msgid "Run the same procedure with the tinyxml2_vendor git repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:131
msgid "IMPORTANT: Again use a folder inside the source folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:136
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Use the location of the folder we cloned as the new project "
"folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:141
msgid "Now all four Projects should be visible in the Project Explorer view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:146
msgid ""
"Clicking in the top right cornder for the Project Explorer view allows us to "
"change the Project Presentation to Hierarchical view. Now it looks like a "
"ROS-2 project as it is on the hard drive. But this view loses the linkage to "
"Egit, so use the Flat Project Presentation. The Egit linkage is good if you "
"want to see e.g. which author wrote which code-line, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:154
msgid "Go to \"C/C++ build\"-section and put \"ament\" into \"Build command\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:159
msgid ""
"Go to \"Behavior\" tab and unselect \"clean\" and put \"build\" into Build "
"textbox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:164
msgid ""
"Before \"Build project\" will work, we need to close Eclipse. Open a shell "
"and source the ROS-2 setup.bash file, then cd into the directory of the "
"eclipse project (here: /home/ubu/rviz2_ws/rviz2_ws) and start Eclipse from "
"inside this directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:170
msgid ""
"Now code completion, egit annotations, eclipse C/C++ Tools, etc. should all "
"work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:176
msgid "Eclipse-indexer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:178
msgid ""
"Opening the main.cpp of rviz2 may show a lot of \"unresolved inclusion\" "
"warnings. To fix this, go to Project->Properties->C++ General->Path and "
"Symbols. Click on the \"References\" tab and select \"ros2_ws\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:186
msgid ""
"Go to C/C++-General->Path-and-Symbols, click on the \"Source locations\" tab "
"and click on \"Link folder\". Choose the location of qt5 includes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:193
msgid ""
"The next image should be shown. It is a good idea to add excludes to the "
"source locations, so that some directories (like \"Build\" and \"Install\") "
"don't get indexed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:200
msgid ""
"Go to C++General->Preprocessor includes, select \"CDT GCC Built in compiler "
"settings [Shared]\" and enter in the \"command to get compiler specs\" text "
"box the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:202
msgid "-std=c++14"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:210
msgid ""
"Go to \"C/C++-General->Indexer\" and select the following in the image. E.g "
"\"index unused headers as c files\" to resolve e.g. QApplication, because "
"the QApplication headers content is only \"#include \"qapplication.h\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:217
msgid ""
"After running the indexer (which happens later, so you will see this also "
"later), you can see what it added"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:223
msgid ""
"After that right-click on the rviz2 project and select \"Indexer->Rebuild\", "
"which will start rebuilding the index (there is an icon in the lower right "
"showing progress). Once the index is finished rebuilding, it should be able "
"to resolve all includes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:231
msgid "Debugging with eclipse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:233
msgid "Go to \"C/C++-Build\" and add to the build command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:235
msgid "-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2/Eclipse-Oxygen-with-ROS-2-and-rviz2.rst:243
msgid ""
"Then in eclipse go to \"Run->Debug Configurations\" and add the following "
"and click on \"Debug\"."
msgstr ""
